# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout.
# Without this, Windows core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, and Prettier
# (endOfLine defaults to "lf") fails every file — breaking `npm run lint`
# and the pre-commit hook for any Windows contributor.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binaries — never normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Raw planar video frames (e2e/fixtures/box.y4m). The header is ASCII and the pixel
# bytes carry no NULs, so git's `text=auto` heuristic classifies these as text — and a
# fill colour whose bytes happen to form CR LF would then be normalized into corruption.
*.y4m  binary
